OpenMMLab, MMDetection, PyTorch, torchvision, COCO, and other project names identify
their respective third-party projects. This repository is not their official
continuation and does not claim their endorsement.

The native worker imports torchvision Faster R-CNN rather than copying its model
implementation. The optional COCO adapter imports pycocotools. Legacy inference
imports the selected MMDetection/OneDL installation. Upstream notices and licenses
remain with those packages. No research paper, external dataset, or external
checkpoint is represented as work by this repository's owner.
